## Diff artifacts (optional)

Per-file diffs are exported for on-demand inspection when prompt size is limited.

Location: {{ .Vars.diff_artifacts_path | default "ttmp/.../various/diffs" }}

Each file diff mirrors the repo path with a `.diff` suffix (e.g., `web/src/main.tsx.diff`).
Only reference these artifacts if you need more context than the prompt includes.
